      "reply_count": 2,
      "retweet_count": 6
    },
    "text": "Praxis-1 dramatically outperforms frontier LLMs on speed and cost. On the same station and tasks, Praxis-1 finished 15.6x faster than GPT-6 Astra driving the arm, at 51x lower cost per completed task. https://t.co/1TlDo0NtiX",
    "urls": [
      "https://x.com/runwayml/status/2120533212359458837/video/1"
    ],
    "note": "",
    "refs": [],
    "url": "https://x.com/runwayml/status/2120533212359458837"
  },
  {
    "id": "2120533166264090874",
    "username": "runwayml",
    "created_at": "2026-11-11T15:04:39.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "bookmark_count": 1,
      "impression_count": 1878,
      "like_count": 19,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "reply_count": 3,
      "retweet_count": 1
    },
    "text": "It also learns new tasks from very little data. With under 30 minutes of teleoperated demos, Praxis-1 succeeded in all 15 simulated trials on Noble Machines’ robot. https://t.co/dhWaL9aG23",
    "urls": [
      "https://x.com/runwayml/status/2120533166264090874/video/1"
    ],
    "note": "",
    "refs": [],
