    "text": "Praxis-1 is the strongest world action model available: #1 on NVIDIA’s RoboLab-120 leaderboard, and ahead of every open-weight VLA on the board, including π0.5 and GR00T N1.6. https://t.co/W8ZZmW8Fo4",
