    "text": "To act for you, an AI agent has to read your email, calendar, messages and files. It ends up knowing more about your life than most of your friends, so you should get to choose where it runs.\n\nToday we're releasing QVAC BotPsy, a 0.8B model that sets alarms, moves meetings and https://t.co/q9RR8UMob0",
